<div id="u-credit-00473-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/allen-z" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5991926); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5991926&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607972953" alt="Allen Z" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5991926)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/allen-z" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5991926); return false;">Allen Z</a></span></p>
